(preferably titans) pets.
The best solution we came up with would be to play as a Valk or a
Cav, go to the Quest levels and genocide H and a for Valk or h for
Cav. Now, accoring to the wikia, the probabilities of random
monster generation on the valk quest are (cav is equivalent):

    * 96/175 (55%) fire ant
    * 24/175 (14%) random a
    * 24/175 (14%) fire giant
    * 6/175 (3%) random H
    * 1/7 (14%) normal random monster


So, if a and H are genocided, does it mean 86% of monsters will be
Titans?

