http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/343/spl2-343.html#familiar
"A monster of your starting pet type (kitten, little dog or pony;
1/3 chance) or random monster (2/3 chance) is created. In any case,
it becomes your pet if it is capable of being tamed."

Considering a level 30 valk with robe and no metallic armour, and 23
WIS (18+ 5 from HoB), we have 69% failure rate.
For a level 30 caveman with robe and do metallic armour, and 24 INT
(19+5) we have a 70% failure rate.
(http://runc1ble.org/spells.html)

Wishing for the Eye would make it more quick to raise that army.

